isolate-active-title = Emergency mode is on
isolate-active-summary = The network is cut except for { $count } allowed address(es). Undo the change in History to restore it.
isolate-may-affect-network = Everything that uses the network stops, except the addresses you allowed.
isolate-may-affect-remote = A remote session (SSH, remote desktop) is cut unless its address is allowed.
isolate-may-affect-updates = Updates, backups and sync pause until the change is undone.
